/-!
# Segmented inverse (S2): Lemma 19 at the fitted (cost-row) parameters

`lemma19_seg_fit`: any `1 ≤ λ ≤ d k`, `w = 7k` (`k = ⌊√d⌋ + 1`), `R = ⌊p/7⌋`, `P = segPF p d s`,
error `≤ 9`, `‖B₀‖ ≤ 1/2`, and `B₀ 0 = 0` exactly (`B0seg_zero`). The parameter definitions and the
